# Workspace formats (Format Plugins)
error-fmt-commit-invalid = That version reference isn't valid. It must be 40 lower-case letters or digits.
error-fmt-kind-not-proposable = ordin can't suggest what kind of file that is. Choose the kind yourself.
error-fmt-not-recognised = ordin doesn't recognise this folder's layout. Check you chose the right one.
error-fmt-package-manifest-invalid = The package description file is unreadable or is missing a name or version. Fix it and try again.
error-fmt-part-invalid = ordin couldn't prepare one of the parts of this assistant. Check it and try again.
error-fmt-path-invalid = That file path isn't allowed. Use a path inside the workspace without special characters.
error-fmt-root-not-single = ordin needs exactly one workspace profile in this folder, but found none or several.
error-fmt-tree-too-large = This folder is too big to read. It must have no more than 20,000 files and 256 MiB.
error-fmt-version-untested = This folder uses a version of the format that hasn't been tested with ordin, so the change was not made.
error-fmt-write-unsupported = ordin can't write changes to Claude Code or Copilot files in this way.
